    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWelcome to No. 33 Redwood Court, nestled in a small, quiet cul de sac, in the heart of Kilnamanagh.\nThis stunning three bedroom semi-detached home comes to the market in excellent condition throughout, having been lovingly maintained and beautifully decorated by its current, long term (over 40 years) owner-occupier and boasting a fantastic attic conversion, as well as a large sunroom to the rear.From the entrance hallway, the living room is located immediately to your left, with large windows and a feature fireplace. To the rear is a separate, spacious kitchen/dining area - the ideal setting for entertaining family and friends!The sunroom sits just off the dining area and, in turn, leads to the rear garden - a light and airy haven - perfect for long summer evenings and barbeques or even just to relax and see out the evening.Upstairs, there are three bedrooms (two double), a spacious attic conversion and a family bathroom completes the accommodation.Kilnamanagh is an extremely sought-after area and is ideally located just off the Belgard Road, with access to excellent amenities and easy access to the M50 and N7. Dunnes Stores and the local LUAS stop are both within short walking distance, while the Square Shopping centre and Newlands Cross are both within a five-minute drive of Redwood Court.This is a fantastic opportunity to purchase a beautiful family home in a quiet, sought-after development, with everything on your doorstep.Call or email for viewing details."
      },
